// 压缩图片：把图片缩放到合理尺寸并转成 JPEG，避免体积过大导致 localStorage 写入失败
function compressImage(file, maxDim, quality){
  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
    const reader = new FileReader();
    reader.onload = (e) => {
      const img = new Image();
      img.onload = () => {
        let { width, height } = img;
        if (width > maxDim || height > maxDim){
          if (width > height){
            height = Math.round(height * (maxDim / width));
            width = maxDim;
          } else {
            width = Math.round(width * (maxDim / height));
            height = maxDim;
          }
        }
        const canvas = document.createElement("canvas");
        canvas.width = width;
        canvas.height = height;
        canvas.getContext("2d").drawImage(img, 0, 0, width, height);
        resolve(canvas.toDataURL("image/jpeg", quality));
      };
      img.onerror = () => reject(new Error("图片解析失败"));
      img.src = e.target.result;
    };
    reader.onerror = () => reject(new Error("图片读取失败"));
    reader.readAsDataURL(file);
  });
}


function baobaoLoadImageSource(source){
  return new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{
    if(!source)return reject(new Error("没有图片"));
    if(source instanceof File){
      const reader=new FileReader();
      reader.onload=e=>resolve(e.target.result);
      reader.onerror=()=>reject(new Error("图片读取失败"));
      reader.readAsDataURL(source);
      return;
    }
    resolve(String(source));
  });
}

function compressImageToBudget(source, options){
  const opt=Object.assign({
    maxDim:1080,
    quality:.72,
    maxChars:360000,
    minDim:420,
    minQuality:.42,
    mime:"image/webp"
  },options||{});

  return baobaoLoadImageSource(source).then(src=>new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{
    const img=new Image();
    img.onload=()=>{
      let width=img.naturalWidth||img.width;
      let height=img.naturalHeight||img.height;
      const scale=Math.min(1,opt.maxDim/Math.max(width,height));
      width=Math.max(1,Math.round(width*scale));
      height=Math.max(1,Math.round(height*scale));

      const canvas=document.createElement("canvas");
      const ctx=canvas.getContext("2d",{alpha:false});
      let quality=opt.quality;
      let attempts=0;

      function render(){
        canvas.width=width;
        canvas.height=height;
        ctx.fillStyle="#fff";
        ctx.fillRect(0,0,width,height);
        ctx.drawImage(img,0,0,width,height);

        let result=canvas.toDataURL(opt.mime,quality);
        if(!result.startsWith("data:"+opt.mime)){
          result=canvas.toDataURL("image/jpeg",quality);
        }

        attempts++;
        if(result.length<=opt.maxChars||attempts>=10||(width<=opt.minDim&&height<=opt.minDim&&quality<=opt.minQuality)){
          resolve(result);
          return;
        }

        if(quality>opt.minQuality+.05){
          quality=Math.max(opt.minQuality,quality-.09);
        }else{
          width=Math.max(opt.minDim,Math.round(width*.82));
          height=Math.max(opt.minDim,Math.round(height*.82));
          quality=Math.min(opt.quality,.68);
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(render);
      }

      render();
    };
    img.onerror=()=>reject(new Error("图片解析失败"));
    img.src=src;
  }));
}

function baobaoAssignImageSafely(field,value,render,successMessage){
  const old=state[field];
  state[field]=value;
  if(typeof render==="function")render();

  if(saveLocal()){
    if(typeof showToast==="function")showToast(successMessage);
    return true;
  }

  state[field]=old;
  if(typeof render==="function")render();
  if(typeof showToast==="function")showToast("存储空间已满，已保留原来的图片",true);
  return false;
}

async function baobaoCompactExistingMedia(){
  if(state.mediaStorageCompactedV183)return;

  try{
    let changed=false;
    const tasks=[
      ["wallpaper",{maxDim:1080,quality:.68,maxChars:330000}],
      ["lockWallpaper",{maxDim:1080,quality:.68,maxChars:330000}],
      ["coverImage",{maxDim:900,quality:.68,maxChars:230000}],
      ["avatar",{maxDim:420,quality:.76,maxChars:85000}],
      ["charAvatar",{maxDim:420,quality:.76,maxChars:85000}]
    ];

    for(const [key,opt] of tasks){
      const value=state[key];
      if(typeof value==="string"&&value.startsWith("data:image/")&&value.length>opt.maxChars){
        state[key]=await compressImageToBudget(value,opt);
        changed=true;
      }
    }

    if(state.chatBackground&&state.chatBackground.type==="image"){
      const value=state.chatBackground.value;
      if(typeof value==="string"&&value.startsWith("data:image/")&&value.length>260000){
        state.chatBackground.value=await compressImageToBudget(value,{maxDim:900,quality:.66,maxChars:260000});
        changed=true;
      }
    }

    state.mediaStorageCompactedV183=true;
    saveLocal();
    renderWallpaper();
    if(typeof renderWeChatApp==="function")renderWeChatApp();
    if(typeof applyChatBackground==="function")applyChatBackground();
  }catch(e){
    console.warn("旧媒体整理未完成：",e);
  }
}

function lockWallpaperChosen(input){
  if(!input.files||!input.files[0])return;
  compressImageToBudget(input.files[0],{
    maxDim:1080,quality:.70,maxChars:330000,minDim:520
  }).then(dataUrl=>{
    baobaoAssignImageSafely("lockWallpaper",dataUrl,renderWallpaper,"锁屏壁纸已更换");
    input.value="";
  }).catch(()=>showToast("图片读取失败，请换一张图片",true));
}
