// 把 AI 返回的「心声：/反应：/画面：」三段文本拆开（容错：允许空格、markdown加粗符号；解析不到时兜底显示原始内容）
function parseInnerVoiceResponse(text){
  const clean = (text || "").replace(/\*\*/g, "").replace(/\*/g, "").replace(/^#+\s*/gm, "");
  const grab = (label, nextLabels) => {
    const stopParts = nextLabels.map(l => l + "\\s*[：:]");
    const stop = stopParts.length ? "(?:" + stopParts.join("|") + ")" : "(?!.)"; // 没有下一个标签时，只在真正的末尾停
    const re = new RegExp(label + "\\s*[：:]\\s*([\\s\\S]*?)(?:" + stop + "|$)");
    const m = clean.match(re);
    return m ? m[1].trim() : "";
  };
  let quote = grab("心声", ["反应", "画面"]);
  let body = grab("反应", ["画面"]);
  let final = grab("画面", []);

  if(!quote && !body && !final){
    // 三段格式完全没匹配上：不要让面板卡在"还没有心声"，直接把原始回复整段显示出来
    const sentences = clean.split(/(?<=[。！？!?\n])/).map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean);
    quote = (sentences[0] || clean).slice(0, 20);
    body = clean;
  }
  return { quote, body, final };
}

// 每次用户发消息都会调用：让 AI 以角色本人视角生成一段心理描写
async function generateInnerVoiceForCurrentPersona(){
  const p = window.currentChatPersona;
  if(!p) return;
  const personaId = p.id;
  setInnerVoiceLoading(true);
  try{
    const history = (state.chatMessages || [])
      .filter(m => m.type !== "image")
      .slice(-6)
      .map(m => (m.role === "user" ? "用户" : (p.name || "TA")) + "：" + m.content)
      .join("\n");

    const sys = "你现在不是在扮演角色对话，而是要写出角色「" + (p.name || "该角色") + "」看到用户最新消息后的内心独白（心理描写），旁观视角，不要出现对用户说话的语气。"
      + "请严格按下面的格式输出三行，不要输出任何多余的解释、标题或引号：\n"
      + "心声：（一句很短、很口语化的内心声音，不超过20个字）\n"
      + "反应：（50~100字左右，第一人称视角，描述TA看到这条最新消息后真实的心理活动和情绪）\n"
      + "画面：（30~80字左右，第三人称旁白视角，描写TA当下所在的环境、动作或表情细节）\n\n"
      + "角色背景：" + (p.persona || "（无）") + "\n角色性格：" + (p.personality || "（无）");

    const reply = await sendChatCompletion([
      { role: "system", content: sys },
      { role: "user", content: "最近的对话：\n" + (history || "（暂无对话）") }
    ]);

    const parsed = parseInnerVoiceResponse(reply);
    if(!state.innerVoiceData) state.innerVoiceData = {};
    state.innerVoiceData[personaId] = { ...parsed, updatedAt: Date.now() };
    const heartBtn = document.getElementById("innerVoiceBtn");
    const overlayOpen = document.getElementById("innerVoiceOverlay")
      && document.getElementById("innerVoiceOverlay").classList.contains("show");
    if(heartBtn && !overlayOpen) heartBtn.classList.add("has-new-voice");
    saveLocal();

    if(window.currentChatPersona && window.currentChatPersona.id === personaId
       && $("innerVoiceOverlay") && $("innerVoiceOverlay").classList.contains("show")){
      renderInnerVoiceCard(window.currentChatPersona);
    }
  }catch(e){
    console.warn("心声生成失败：", e.message);
    showToast("心声生成失败：" + e.message, true);
  } finally {
    setInnerVoiceLoading(false);
  }
}

// ===== Chat 首页：聊天列表缓存（聊过的人自动生成卡片，不丢失）=====
function touchChatOrder(id){
  if(!state.chatOrder) state.chatOrder = [];
  state.chatOrder = state.chatOrder.filter(x => String(x) !== String(id));
  state.chatOrder.unshift(id);
}
function renderChatList(){
  const wrap = $("chatRecentList");
  if(!wrap) return;
  if(!state.chatOrder) state.chatOrder = [];
  if(!state.chatRecords) state.chatRecords = {};
  const ids = state.chatOrder.filter(id =>
    (state.personas||[]).some(p => String(p.id) === String(id)) &&
    state.chatRecords[id] && state.chatRecords[id].length
  );
  if(!ids.length){
    wrap.innerHTML = '<div class="chat-recent-empty">暂无聊天记录</div>';
    return;
  }
  wrap.innerHTML = ids.map(id => {
    const p = state.personas.find(x => String(x.id) === String(id));
    const msgs = state.chatRecords[id] || [];
    const last = msgs[msgs.length - 1];
    const lastText = last ? (
      last.type === "image"
        ? "[图片]"
        : last.type === "transfer"
          ? (
              (last.transferStatus==="received"||last.transferStatus==="已收款" ? "[已收款] " :
               last.transferStatus==="returned"||last.transferStatus==="已退回" ? "[已退回] " :
               "[转账] ") +
              "¥" + Number(last.amount||last.content||0).toFixed(2)
            )
          : (last.content || "")
    ) : "";
    const avatarHtml = p.photo ? `<img src="${p.photo}">` : "";
    return `<div class="chat-recent-item" onclick="startPersonaChat('${p.id}')">
      <div class="chat-recent-avatar">${avatarHtml}</div>
      <div class="chat-recent-info">
        <div class="chat-recent-name">${escapeHtml(p.name || "未命名")}</div>
        <div class="chat-recent-last">${escapeHtml(lastText)}</div>
      </div>
    </div>`;
  }).join("");
}

